# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the
# committing OS, so cross-platform editing (Windows/macOS/Linux) doesn't
# show every line of a file as "changed" purely from CRLF vs LF -- this is
# what caused ~372 files under data/ to show as modified with no real
# content change (confirmed via `git diff`: every line touched, nothing
# actually different) after editing this repo on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binary formats untouched -- never text-normalize these.
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.sqlite binary
*.xlsx binary
